---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "@/components/nav.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Web Development Services in NRW — What to Expect | Abdalrahman Midani" description="What to expect when hiring a web developer in North Rhine-Westphalia. From requirements to deployment — a guide to professional web development services.">
  <Nav />

  <article class="text-[var(--white)] py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sec)] mb-4">
        <a href="/" class="hover:underline">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <a href="/blog" class="hover:underline">Blog</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        Web Development Services in NRW
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sec)] mb-2">June 1, 2025 · <span class="reading-time"></span> min read</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium mb-6">Web Development Services in North Rhine-Westphalia – What to Expect</h1>

      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-[var(--white-icon)] leading-relaxed space-y-4">
        <p>If you're searching for a <strong>web developer in North Rhine-Westphalia</strong>, you're likely building or improving a digital product. Whether you're a startup in Münster, a mid-sized company in Düsseldorf, or an agency in Cologne, the process of hiring and working with a developer follows a similar pattern.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] mt-8">What a professional web development engagement looks like</h2>

        <p>As a <strong>senior front-end developer based in Ochtrup, NRW</strong>, I've worked with companies ranging from blockchain startups to digital agencies. Here's what you can expect when you hire a professional web developer in Germany.</p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] mt-6">1. Discovery and requirements</h3>
        <p>Every project starts with understanding your goals. What problem are you solving? Who are your users? What's your timeline? This phase defines the scope, tech stack, and deliverables.</p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] mt-6">2. Architecture and design</h3>
        <p>With requirements clear, I design the application architecture. This includes component structure, state management, API integration points, and security considerations from day one — especially important for GDPR-compliant applications in Germany.</p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] mt-6">3. Development and iteration</h3>
        <p>I build using modern frameworks like Vue.js and React, with TypeScript for type safety. You get regular updates, a live preview environment, and the ability to provide feedback throughout.</p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] mt-6">4. Security review</h3>
        <p>Before launch, every application gets a security audit. I check for OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities, test authentication flows, and verify data handling practices. This is where my <strong>cybersecurity background</strong> adds value beyond standard development.</p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] mt-6">5. Deployment and support</h3>
        <p>I handle deployment, set up monitoring, and provide post-launch support. Your application is live, secure, and maintainable.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] mt-8">Why location matters</h2>
        <p>Hiring a <strong>web developer in North Rhine-Westphalia</strong> means working with someone who understands the local market, data privacy regulations (GDPR), and can meet in person when needed. Being based in Ochtrup, I serve clients throughout NRW — from the Ruhr region to the Rhine valley.</p>

        <p>Looking for a <strong>front-end developer in NRW</strong>? <a href="/contact" class="text-[var(--sec)] hover:underline">Get in touch</a> and let's discuss your project.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
